      "Golden West College",
      "Veterans Resource Center",
      "The Veterans Resource Center (VRC) is committed to supporting the unique needs of Golden West College’s military-connected student population. We achieve this by collaborating with various campus departments and community organizations, ensuring students have access to the resources they need to succeed. Our team is here to serve veterans, active-duty service members, reservists, and the spouses or dependents of veterans. Whether you're pursuing an Associate’s degree, a Certificate of Achievement, or planning to transfer to a four-year university, we welcome you to the Veterans Resource Center. We look forward to supporting you on your journey!",
